  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2260\">\n<p data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2144\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2142\">Positive (Pathogenic/Likely Pathogenic Variant):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2260\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2192\">\n<p data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2192\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Confirms or supports clinical diagnosis.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2260\">\n<p data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2260\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Guides <strong data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2259\">targeted therapy, surveillance, and family testing</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2396\">\n<p data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2311\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2309\">Variant of Uncertain Significance (VUS):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2396\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2396\">\n<p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2396\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Needs <strong data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2393\">further segregation studies, re-analysis, or functional validation</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2544\">\n<p data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2416\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2414\">Negative:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2544\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2468\">\n<p data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2468\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No clinically significant variants detected.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2544\">\n<p data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2544\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Does not rule out genetic disease (may require WGS or further panels).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2653\">\n<p data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2574\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2572\">Secondary Findings:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2653\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2653\">\n<p data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2653\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Reported only if <strong data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2616\">patient consent</strong> is provided (per ACMG SF v3.1 list).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
